{"summary":"Rise from the crypt and rebuild your home","description":"The living have razed your home: The Necropolis. Become a necromancer king and raise undead warriors from the remains of your enemies. With each victory, your army will grow stronger and your city will become more powerful, allowing you to take on even tougher challenges. Take back your land, free the undead souls and secure a future for the undead. Undead Horde 2 is a necromantic action game with elements from RPG, strategy and hack'n'slash.\n\nFeatures:\n- Raise undead warriors of your choosing from enemy remains\n- Command undead armies of over 100 units\n- Rebuild the Necropolis and unlock new talents, new upgrades and new powers.\n- Find and unlock unique undead minions to raise\n- Level up and become the savior of Necropolis\n- Conquer the world and save the undead souls","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z6vbMU84vP4?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eHT5LXv9clBEv8p7PTs3S27RP_7xROIYtRi4RePU46b4-S7UsgHpJn8379hYrmBCcRxMbTJiKcOAQbQUYM7cvg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sfXznCzoF6t54CILv9faTTwk88sZKtamdk3jLfLKeAYz-JJ6JCLePBPyRECYxNZztIbHMJsGiYlYpe4PTtVU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2MpaDWAIJkIyCZIFYP8k_dVfC3TpHWKjCId7gbPTRGV1QO_HUzewmra54O5X5MC6sP7j7E6wmczZl-nO17qt","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uX6aCdiwA29a1eZ9fbqEitjy9Sx2pjoewkX4ilaIQLjCgzr-cq9JcLF2ohtWlMQMRwI_iZgu4EbaBsyDg7qU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2TVwWIvPnPd9qJChfnSlw8P-VmdM0prt0rrc04tw3k-U1PSIgUh-16tSDqbaYKxD5L1lmSmYqeQahECBavxR","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4qKHVPl0Gdg4qX9doc4FkfDzvLFfqgq8es4hFTH9ntED79tTp8p34jQyrMA_NIyADgX9s_tC7b7EKidt_CTlEA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pPjSdh8gg46tDu-j4vkpfyct2bRe42POFK8G0ruVdyHAEWg-dzGbR3EWLom539dM-V8MwAIQzPdK4rvfMGSNjg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c5VgjOUsUQdCYFNE2Qfhc7H0h3dE1